  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The dwelling is unsuitable for conversion to an HMO and in an inappropriate location for such a use, the proposal would be unacceptable in principle contrary to Local Plan policy SC10",
    "Reason : 2 - The hip-to-gable conversion and rear dormer extension appear as overly dominant and poorly designed additions to the property. The retention of these elements in their current forms would result in harm to the character and appearance of the local area and streetscene contrary to Local Plan policy CC1, CC2 and SC7 together with the adopted Hounslow Character, Sustainability and Design Codes SPD",
    "Reason : 3 - Without evidence to the contrary the proposal would result in a proliferation of bins causing harm to the character and appearance of the local area contrary to Local Plan policies CC1, CC2 and SC10",
    "Reason : 4 - The provision of an HMO in a property and an area unsuitable for such a use would result in an increased level of noise and disturbance to neighbouring residents contrary to local plan policies CC1, CC2 and SC10.",
    "Reason : 5 - Without evidence to the contrary the proposal would result in harm to the safety and efficiency of the local transport network contrary to Local Plan policy EC2"
  ],
